                           </font>
                        </Text>
                        <Text strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="To add a component into the circuit, simply click on the Toolbal button &quot;Add ____&quot; representing the component you wish to add, then click anywhere on the drawing area to place it. Your cursor will display what component you will be placing, but its position and size may not be entirely accurate. The wire must be drawn by dragging your mouse around the screen." wrappingWidth="577.9453125" />
