                        </Text>
                        <Text layoutX="20.0" layoutY="33.0" strokeType="OUTSIDE" strokeWidth="0.0" text="To move components around, make sure you are using the &quot;Select&quot; tool. It is represented by the default cursor. Once a component is selected, you can move it, rotate it, copy, cut or delete it, in a very intuitive fashion, using the same keyboard shortcuts as other apps." wrappingWidth="577.9453125" />
